{"openapi":"3.0.0","paths":{"/api/v1/badges/{credential_type}":{"get":{"description":"Returns a binary image for the requested Bluprynt verification badge. Responses are aggressively cached via `Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable`.","operationId":"badges.getBadge","parameters":[{"name":"credential_type","required":true,"in":"path","description":"Credential type to display a badge for","schema":{"enum":["kyi_verified","proof_of_collateral"],"type":"string"}},{"name":"size","required":false,"in":"query","description":"Badge size in pixels (ignored when variant=full). Note: 64 falls back to 32px as no 64px icon asset exists.","schema":{"enum":["16","24","32","64"],"type":"string"}},{"name":"format","required":false,"in":"query","description":"Image format","schema":{"enum":["svg","png","webp"],"type":"string"}},{"name":"theme","required":false,"in":"query","description":"Badge colour theme","schema":{"enum":["dark","light"],"type":"string"}},{"name":"variant","required":false,"in":"query","description":"icon = square icon; full = pill badge with text (size ignored)","schema":{"enum":["icon","full"],"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Badge image","content":{"image/svg+xml":{"schema":{"type":"string","format":"binary"}},"image/png":{"schema":{"type":"string","format":"binary"}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid credential_type or query parameter value"},"415":{"description":"Unsupported Media Type — WebP is not yet available"}},"summary":"Get verification badge","tags":["Badges"]}},"/kyi/v1/tokens":{"get":{"description":"Finds indexed tokens by CAIP-19, or by address with an optional chain slug, and returns their KYI verification, discovered authorities and wallet-proof verifications. Provide either `caip19`, or `address` with optional `chain_slug`.","operationId":"kyi.lookupTokens","parameters":[{"name":"chain_slug","required":false,"in":"query","description":"Chain slug, used with address","schema":{"example":"ethereum"}},{"name":"address","required":false,"in":"query","description":"Token address","schema":{"example":"0xA0b86991c6218b36c1d19D4a2e9Eb0cE3606eB48"}},{"name":"caip19","required":false,"in":"query","description":"CAIP-19 asset ID","schema":{"example":"eip155:1/erc20:0xa0b86991c6218b36c1d19d4a2e9eb0ce3606eb48"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Matching tokens","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/KyiTokenLookup"}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid, missing or mixed query parameters"},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"message":{"type":"string","example":"Invalid API key"},"error":{"type":"string","example":"Unauthorized"},"statusCode":{"type":"number","example":401}}}}}},"404":{"description":"No indexed token matches; body is `{ \"kyi_verified\": false, \"data\": [] }`","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/KyiTokenLookup"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"message":{"type":"string","example":"Internal Server Error"},"error":{"type":"string","example":"Internal Server Error"},"statusCode":{"type":"number","example":500}}}}}},"502":{"description":"An upstream service is unavailable"}},"summary":"Look up KYI verification of tokens","tags":["KYI"],"security":[{"api-key":[]}]}},"/reference/v1/chains":{"get":{"description":"Every chain Bluprynt can identify, testnets included (`mainnet: false`). Use it to build a `chain_slug` picker for `GET /kyi/v1/tokens`, or to map `caip2` and `chain_slug` values in lookup results to display names. The list changes rarely; cache it rather than fetching it per request.\n\nTechnical reference of chains Bluprynt can identify. Inclusion does not imply live traffic, indexed assets, or KYI verifications on that chain.","operationId":"reference.listChains","parameters":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"All chains","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ReferenceChainList"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"message":{"type":"string","example":"Invalid API key"},"error":{"type":"string","example":"Unauthorized"},"statusCode":{"type":"number","example":401}}}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"message":{"type":"string","example":"Internal Server Error"},"error":{"type":"string","example":"Internal Server Error"},"statusCode":{"type":"number","example":500}}}}}}},"summary":"List chains","tags":["Reference"],"security":[{"api-key":[]}]}},"/reference/v1/chains/{caip2}":{"get":{"description":"Resolve one CAIP-2 id, such as a `token.caip2` from a `GET /kyi/v1/tokens` result or the part of a CAIP-19 id before `/`, to its slug and name. Returns 404 for an id Bluprynt does not know.\n\nTechnical reference of chains Bluprynt can identify. Inclusion does not imply live traffic, indexed assets, or KYI verifications on that chain.","operationId":"reference.getChain","parameters":[{"name":"caip2","required":true,"in":"path","description":"CAIP-2 chain id, used as-is in the path (`:` needs no encoding)","schema":{"example":"eip155:1","type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"The chain","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ReferenceChain"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"message":{"type":"string","example":"Invalid API key"},"error":{"type":"string","example":"Unauthorized"},"statusCode":{"type":"number","example":401}}}}}},"404":{"description":"Unknown CAIP-2 id"},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"message":{"type":"string","example":"Internal Server Error"},"error":{"type":"string","example":"Internal Server Error"},"statusCode":{"type":"number","example":500}}}}}}},"summary":"Get a chain by CAIP-2 id","tags":["Reference"],"security":[{"api-key":[]}]}}},"info":{"title":"Bluprynt Public API","description":"","version":"1.0.0","contact":{}},"tags":[{"name":"Badges","description":"Verification badge assets"},{"name":"KYI","description":"Know Your Issuer verification lookups"},{"name":"Reference","description":"Reference data for building requests and reading responses. It describes what Bluprynt can address, not what is happening on it.\n\n**Chains** are the networks Bluprynt can identify, keyed by [CAIP-2](https://chainagnostic.org/CAIPs/caip-2) id with a stable `slug`. Use them to:\n\n- **Pick a `chain_slug`** for `GET /kyi/v1/tokens?address=…&chain_slug=…`. Any `slug` listed here is accepted.\n- **Label lookup results.** Each `/kyi/v1/tokens` item carries `token.caip2` and `token.chain_slug`; resolve either to a display `name` here.\n- **Read a CAIP-19 id.** In `eip155:1/erc20:0xa0b8…`, the part before `/` is the chain's `caip2`.\n- **Separate production from test networks** with `mainnet`.\n\nThe list only changes when Bluprynt adds support for a chain. Fetch it once at startup or cache it for a day instead of calling it per request.\n\nTechnical reference of chains Bluprynt can identify. Inclusion does not imply live traffic, indexed assets, or KYI verifications on that chain. To learn whether a specific token is indexed or KYI-verified, call `GET /kyi/v1/tokens`."}],"servers":[{"url":"/"}],"components":{"securitySchemes":{"api-key":{"type":"apiKey","in":"header","name":"Authorization","description":"Enter API key directly"}},"schemas":{"KyiToken":{"type":"object","properties":{"caip19":{"type":"string","example":"eip155:1/erc20:0xa0b86991c6218b36c1d19d4a2e9eb0ce3606eb48"},"caip2":{"type":"string","example":"eip155:1"},"chain_slug":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"example":"ethereum"},"address":{"type":"string","example":"0xA0b86991c6218b36c1d19D4a2e9Eb0cE3606eB48"},"standard":{"